# Mechanical Chicken from An OOX of Your Own: rescue Oglethorpe Obnoticus's
# three homing robots, then visit him in Booty Bay.
# Sources: quests.json (the OOX chain, its givers and turn-ins); items.json (the
# beacons' droppers, pfQuest rates); Forever client 1.60.1.70338. The reward is
# general Era knowledge (not in quests.json).

step OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon in Feralas
  tip Each robot starts with a distress beacon that mobs in its zone drop (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data). Start in Feralas.
  collect 8705 x1 nearest

step Rescue OOX-22/FE
  tip Take the beacon to OOX-22/FE in a cave near Feral Scar Vale, then escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay; keep it for later.
  accept 2766
  turnin 2766
  accept 2767
  complete 2767                       -- Escort OOX-22/FE

step OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon in Tanaris
  zone Tanaris
  tip Most Tanaris mobs can drop OOX-17/TN's beacon (about 0.5-3% per kill in our data).
  collect 8623 x1 nearest

step Rescue OOX-17/TN
  zone Tanaris
  tip Take the beacon to OOX-17/TN in Tanaris, then escort it to Steamwheedle Port. Its turn-in is in Booty Bay too.
  accept 351
  turnin 351
  accept 648
  complete 648                        -- Escort OOX-17/TN

step OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon in the Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Most Hinterlands mobs can drop OOX-09/HL's beacon (about 1-2.5% per kill in our data).
  collect 8704 x1 nearest

step Rescue OOX-09/HL
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Take the beacon to OOX-09/HL at the head of the river near Skulk Rock, then escort it to the shore beyond Overlook Cliff.
  accept 485
  turnin 485
  accept 836
  complete 836                        -- Escort OOX-09/HL

step Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Oglethorpe Obnoticus is in Booty Bay. With all three robots home he offers An OOX of Your Own, whose reward is the Mechanical Chicken; it needs level 45.
  turnin 2767
  turnin 648
  turnin 836
  level 45
  accept 3721
  turnin 3721
  collect 10398 @28.4,76.4            -- Mechanical Chicken
